# CNI installation plan (reference only)

Selected provider: `${cni_provider}`

Approved manifest or chart reference: `${cni_manifest_reference}`

Permitted values are `cilium`, `calico`, and `flannel`. This plan is not an
installer and does not download, apply, or render a CNI manifest. Before a later
approved installation, confirm compatibility with `${kubernetes_version}`, pod
CIDR `${pod_cidr}`, network policy requirements, MTU, egress policy, and the
control-plane endpoint `${control_plane_endpoint}`.
